OL,3,GNEWSABoy hands himself in after Bradley
OL,4,ALowery taunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has handed himself
OL,7,Finto West Midlands Police after a video
OL,8,Fposted on social media appeared to show
OL,9,Fa Coventry City fan taunting opposition
OL,10,FSunderland fans with a photo of Bradley
OL,11,FLowery.
OL,13,FSunderland fan Bradley, who died aged
OL,14,Fsix in 2017 after being diagnosed with
OL,15,Fa rare childhood cancer, captured the
OL,16,Fhearts of the football world.
OL,18,FThe Sky Blues said they were
OL,19,Finvestigating the video footage from
OL,20,FSaturday's Premier League match and
OL,21,FBradley's mother, Gemma, issued an
OL,22,Femotional statement.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
