OL,3,GNEWSABoy hands himself in after Bradley
OL,4,ALowery taunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Police said they had
OL,7,Fbegun an investigation. "A 14-year-old
OL,8,Fboy has since handed himself in and
OL,9,Fwill be spoken with in due course," a
OL,10,Fspokesperson said.
